1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Like I said, we've decided to put you in the field.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Alright, our first mission.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Here we go.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,000
So, what are we doing?

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
I assume it's something befitting royalty such as myself?

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Yeah, it's a real honor. Go to Saucy Village for some boar hunting.

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Huh? Hunting boar?

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
That is a terrible mission.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
No, it's not! You take that back!

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
I can break down a boar with my bare hands! Easy!

14
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
No, you can't! Don't even think about trying!

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Either go or die. Your choice.

16
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,000
We'll go!

17
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,000
We'll go!

18
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,000
So what if it's boar hunting?

19
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
We're finally going on a mission!

20
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
I'm getting pumped now!

21
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Yeah!

22
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
I still don't see why you would be sending me.

23
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Come on!

24
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Do you ever do anything but complain?

25
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Actually, that wasn't intended as a complaint.

26
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
It's just, given that I can't control my magic power,

27
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
should I really be going on a mission at all?

28
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Here it is!

29
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Introducing Greer the Cyclone!

30
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,000
So cool!

31
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:48,000
I know, right? Awesome, isn't it?

32
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Yeah!

33
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,000
It's lame!

34
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:54,000
A man never goes back on his word!

35
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Let's do this thing!

36
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Fly!

37
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Oh yeah!

38
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,000
This is amazing, Magna!

39
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,000
We're one with the wind!

40
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Rasta!

41
