73
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,980
You got him.

74
00:05:44,060 --> 00:05:44,860
Not bad, right?

75
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:47,780
But the fun's not over yet.

76
00:05:47,780 --> 00:06:05,780
Now that's what I call good huntin'!

77
00:06:05,780 --> 00:06:08,120
