80
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,240
Child's play!

81
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:15,100
You really are something else.

82
00:06:15,540 --> 00:06:18,440
Well, if this doesn't please Sehi, I don't know what will.

83
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:20,520
Yeah, big piggy party tonight!

84
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:21,940
So wait.

85
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,380
The chief of Saucy Village.

86
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,020
Sehi?

87
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,440
He's a friend of yours?

88
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:28,540
Yeah, me and the old man go way back.

89
00:06:29,380 --> 00:06:32,760
You see, Raaka Village, where I come from, isn't far from here.

90
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:33,840
We're practically neighbors.

91
00:06:34,420 --> 00:06:36,760
I used to get into all kinds of trouble when I was a kid.

92
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:38,540
Yeah, used to.

93
00:06:38,740 --> 00:06:39,800
That's changed how?

94
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:43,300
When I got my grimoire, the sense of power totally went to my head.

95
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:47,180
I flew into Saucy Alkaki thinking I was gonna take over the place or something.

96
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:48,900
Boy, was I wrong!

97
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:51,680
Get, get, get, get, get, get, get!

98
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,220
Get, get, get, get!

99
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:53,040
Get that!

100
00:06:53,040 --> 00:07:02,880
Hey, what do you think you're doing to my village, you little brat?

101
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:03,420
Ha!

102
00:07:03,620 --> 00:07:05,040
You looking for a beating, old man?

103
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:05,800
Let's go!

104
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,360
Not a chance.

105
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:09,260
I won't be the one getting a beating today.

106
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:10,340
Oh, you think so?

107
00:07:11,020 --> 00:07:12,240
Yeah, I do!

108
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:14,360
Ah, crap!

109
00:07:14,780 --> 00:07:15,980
This'll teach you!

110
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:24,020
We're not done.

111
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:26,820
Wait, what?

112
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:29,240
You've earned yourself a spanky.

113
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,420
Ah, damn it, damn it!

114
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:32,160
What are you doing to me?

115
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:34,940
Didn't stop me, though.

116
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:37,680
I took him on a whole bunch of times after that.

117
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:47,900
Game on you!

118
00:07:48,060 --> 00:07:50,620
A real man doesn't attack people without reason!

119
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:55,360
Protecting the weak from those who would hurt them.

120
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:57,260
That's what a real man does!

121
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:58,540
Golden!

122
00:07:58,540 --> 00:08:02,280
Another thing!

123
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:04,500
A real man doesn't make anyone worry!

124
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,600
Nobody knew how to put me in my place like he did.

125
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,460
Sounds strong.

126
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:09,960
Yeah.

127
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:12,300
Oh, he absolutely is.

128
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:18,180
Matter of fact, I found out later that when old Sehi was young, he had enough power to try out for the Magic Knights.

129
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:23,720
You know, he's actually the one who told me I should think about taking the entrance exam in the first place.

130
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:28,480
Not bad. Looks like you can just about hold your own now, boy.

131
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:34,240
Yeah, I've got a better handle on how to use my grimoire these days.

132
00:08:34,580 --> 00:08:39,620
I agree. Which means, you might be ready to take the Magic Knights entrance exam.

133
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:42,660
What? Me? Oh, man, are you going crazy?

134
00:08:43,220 --> 00:08:45,180
Why not? You've got what it takes.

135
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:46,240
Yeah, right.

136
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:50,780
Like a commoner from the middle of nowhere even stands a chance.

137
00:08:51,660 --> 00:08:52,900
Nothing's set in stone!

138
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:57,560
So you're a commoner from way out in the sticks. What's that got to do with anything?

139
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,460
You use your power to build your own future.

140
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,280
I couldn't make that dream come true.

141
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:05,020
But you can.

142
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:05,500
Really?

143
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:08,260
Become a man. It's time.

144
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:14,620
So, what do the Magic Knights do anyway?

145
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,180
You don't even know that much!

146
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:17,300
Ow!

147
00:09:17,300 --> 00:09:23,220
No question. It's all thanks to him that I am who I am today.

148
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:26,400
Obviously, I wound up passing the entrance exam.

149
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:28,840
And when I did, no one was happier than Sehi.

150
00:09:29,620 --> 00:09:30,840
Sounds like a nice guy.

151
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,880
You bet.

152
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:37,340
I know part of the reason he came to the capital was to make a fortune that he could bring back to help improve his village,

153
00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:40,400
but I have a feeling he wanted to see me, too.

154
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:44,740
Of course, in the end, he took me for all I had.

155
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:49,260
I'll never forget that he's the one who taught me about being a real man.

156
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:51,580
I want to be as good a guy as he is someday.

157
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:54,460
I respect him more than anyone, except for y'all...

158
00:09:54,460 --> 00:09:58,740
