161
00:10:07,740 --> 00:10:09,100
It's covered in mist.

162
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:14,320
They've got some pretty weird weather around here, huh?

163
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:17,160
It's not the weather, idiot. It's magic.

164
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:17,840
