247
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:32,980
They don't look like Diamond Kingdom spies.

248
00:14:32,980 --> 00:14:35,980
Or savages come to shake down the place.

249
00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:38,980
So who the hell are they?

250
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:44,480
