251
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:46,480
Perhaps they're here on an unofficial mission.

252
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,480
Another thing I'd like to know.

253
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:52,480
How did they manage to tear their way through the mist and enter the village?

254
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:54,980
The Black Bulls.

255
00:14:54,980 --> 00:15:00,980
The roughest, most undisciplined, most heretical of all the magic knight squads.

256
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:04,980
Dealing with this riffraff would be a waste of precious time.

257
00:15:04,980 --> 00:15:05,980
Five minutes.

258
00:15:05,980 --> 00:15:10,980
Now, we will dispose of these useless villagers in a manner befitting their station.

259
00:15:10,980 --> 00:15:12,980
And then we'll find what we came for.

260
00:15:12,980 --> 00:15:14,980
