264
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:26,980
In the mist, be lost.

265
00:15:26,980 --> 00:15:29,980
You're the ones who need to get lost!

266
00:15:29,980 --> 00:15:33,980
So that's how he was able to cut through my ice magic earlier.

267
00:15:33,980 --> 00:15:36,980
I don't know what kind of magic it is.

268
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:40,980
But that large sword of his can nullify spells.

269
00:15:40,980 --> 00:15:43,980
I can't have him getting too close.

270
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:48,980
I asked you why you tried to massacre these villagers and I want an answer now!

271
00:15:48,980 --> 00:15:50,980
Huh.

272
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:55,980
In this kingdom there are three regions divided by inhabitants.

273
00:15:55,980 --> 00:15:58,980
The noble realm where the nobility reside.

274
00:15:58,980 --> 00:16:01,980
The common realm where the citizenry live.

275
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:03,980
And the Forsaken Realm.

276
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:04,980
Yeah.

277
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:08,980
A saucy village is in the Forsaken Realm.

278
00:16:08,980 --> 00:16:11,980
Most in this realm are of inferior stock.

279
00:16:11,980 --> 00:16:16,980
They are capable of performing only a few meager spells to help with the drudgery of their everyday lives.

280
00:16:16,980 --> 00:16:21,980
They are much like beasts that cannot use tools.

281
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:25,980
You asked why I intend to do away with the villagers.

282
00:16:25,980 --> 00:16:30,980
I am merely attempting to dispose of the useless beasts that might waste my time.

283
00:16:30,980 --> 00:16:31,980
Useless beasts?!

284
00:16:31,980 --> 00:16:32,980
Consider yourself.

285
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:36,980
You have enough magic power to have joined the magic knights.

286
00:16:36,980 --> 00:16:39,980
You must attempt to save them because that is your duty.

287
00:16:39,980 --> 00:16:44,980
But surely you can see what insignificant creatures they truly are.

288
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:51,980
The folks in the upper realms sure have it made.

289
00:16:51,980 --> 00:16:54,980
Living a good life while we work our hands to the bone.

290
00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:57,980
If they're so jealous why don't they just move there?

291
00:16:57,980 --> 00:16:59,980
Well that's much easier said than done.

292
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:00,980
Really?

293
00:17:00,980 --> 00:17:01,980
Why?

294
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:04,980
Only those with powerful magic can live in the upper realms.

295
00:17:04,980 --> 00:17:07,980
They look down upon those who have less magic power.

296
00:17:07,980 --> 00:17:10,980
Despite the fact that all of us are human.

297
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:14,980
Well, I'm gonna join a magic knight squad.

298
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:16,980
Then, I'm gonna become the wizard king.

299
00:17:16,980 --> 00:17:21,980
And when I am, I'll make sure nobody gets looked down on for having weak magic.

300
00:17:21,980 --> 00:17:23,980
That sounds lovely.

301
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:27,980
If it were easy enough for you to do it, already be done.

302
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:29,980
What did you just say to me?!

303
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:31,980
You should respect your elders!

304
00:17:31,980 --> 00:17:35,980
Come on, you could never even be a magic knight, much less the wizard king.

305
00:17:35,980 --> 00:17:37,980
You don't have any magic power.

306
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:44,980
You may think they're nothing but useless beasts.

307
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:48,980
But I'll do whatever I have to to protect them!

308
00:17:48,980 --> 00:17:50,980
Interesting.

309
00:17:50,980 --> 00:17:55,980
These pathetic little animals are truly that important to you.

310
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:59,980
I'll send that ice right back to-

311
00:17:59,980 --> 00:18:04,980
What is this?

312
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:22,980
Ice and Mist Compound Magic. Endless Ice Cage.

313
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:29,980
Do you imagine you can still protect your herd of beasts like this?

314
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:33,980
I have never been particularly fond of doing things slowly but surely.

315
00:18:33,980 --> 00:18:37,980
However, this would seem to be the most effective method.

316
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:39,980
Cluster!

317
00:18:39,980 --> 00:18:40,980
Cluster!

318
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:42,980
Thaw Ice.

319
00:18:42,980 --> 00:18:48,980
So it can not only cancel magic, that sword of yours can reflect it as well.

320
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:51,980
But you're a fool if you think that will defeat me.

321
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:54,980
I can create wave after wave of icy fangs.

322
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:55,980
Go on.

323
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:57,980
Let's see you protect them.

324
00:18:59,980 --> 00:19:00,980
Damn this guy!

325
00:19:00,980 --> 00:19:04,980
Austin and I have our hands full keeping the villagers safe.

326
00:19:04,980 --> 00:19:08,980
What's more, my magic is starting to run out.

327
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:12,980
We're up against four guys powerful enough to be magic knights.

328
00:19:12,980 --> 00:19:16,980
And I have a feeling that one still hasn't shown us everything he can do.

329
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:21,980
This is turning out to be a hell of a first mission for those two.

330
00:19:21,980 --> 00:19:23,980
Things are going south quick.

331
00:19:23,980 --> 00:19:27,980
And if all that was enough to make me give up, I wouldn't be a man!

332
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:29,980
Here we go!

333
00:19:29,980 --> 00:19:32,980
Your fellow commoner is gonna keep you safe and sound!

334
00:19:33,980 --> 00:19:34,980
Mecca!

335
00:19:34,980 --> 00:19:36,980
How long can they hold out?

336
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:45,980
A magic knight who can't even control her magic properly.

337
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:49,980
The Black Bulls must truly be desperate to have accepted this one.

338
00:19:49,980 --> 00:19:56,980
Such fragile beasts incapable even of protecting themselves.

339
00:19:56,980 --> 00:19:59,980
Forsaking them will be your salvation, magic knights.

340
00:19:59,980 --> 00:20:01,980
Go now and live!

341
00:20:01,980 --> 00:20:03,980
And abandon them? Not a chance!

342
00:20:03,980 --> 00:20:07,980
A real man doesn't give up on anyone, no matter how bad it gets!

343
00:20:07,980 --> 00:20:09,980
What's wrong with me?

344
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:11,980
Even though I'm royalty.

345
00:20:11,980 --> 00:20:14,980
Even though I have more magic power than anyone here.

346
00:20:14,980 --> 00:20:16,980
Stay behind us, Noelle!

347
00:20:16,980 --> 00:20:19,980
I'm only holding the others back.

348
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:22,980
There's no point to me being here.

349
00:20:22,980 --> 00:20:25,980
Forsaking them will be your salvation, magic knights.

350
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:30,980
That's right. I am royalty.

351
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:33,980
I can't die in some backwater village.

352
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:36,980
I'll go. Just leave and...

353
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:39,980
Miss Magic Knight, please help us!

354
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:43,980
We need you!

355
00:20:45,980 --> 00:20:48,980
This little girl is looking me in the eye and begging for help.

356
00:20:50,980 --> 00:20:51,980
I have to protect her!

357
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:52,980
I have to protect her!

358
00:20:57,980 --> 00:20:58,980
That looks like...

359
00:20:58,980 --> 00:20:59,980
A new spell?

360
00:21:04,980 --> 00:21:05,980
I won't run!

361
00:21:05,980 --> 00:21:06,980
Never!

362
00:21:06,980 --> 00:21:21,980
I will protect them! I am royalty!

363
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:22,980
What's more...

364
00:21:22,980 --> 00:21:24,980
I am a member of the Black Bulls!

365
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:25,980
I will protect them!

366
00:21:25,980 --> 00:21:27,980
I am royalty!

367
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:28,980
What's more...

368
00:21:28,980 --> 00:21:29,980
I am a member of the Black Bulls!

369
00:21:29,980 --> 00:21:31,980
I am a member of the Black Bulls!

370
00:21:31,980 --> 00:21:37,980
I will protect them! I am royalty! What's more, I am a member of the Black Bulls!

371
00:22:01,980 --> 00:22:18,980
I am a member of the Black Bulls! I am a member of the Black Bulls!

372
00:22:18,980 --> 00:22:22,980
It's strange, it's weird.

373
00:22:22,980 --> 00:22:28,980
If you want to laugh, you'll be fine.

374
00:22:28,980 --> 00:22:35,980
I want to be what you want to do.

375
00:22:35,980 --> 00:22:42,980
I want to be the same morning.

376
00:22:42,980 --> 00:22:49,980
I want to be the same tomorrow.

377
00:22:49,980 --> 00:22:52,980
I want to be the same tomorrow.

378
00:22:52,980 --> 00:22:54,980
I want to be the same tomorrow.

379
00:23:12,980 --> 00:23:19,980
Oink, oink, oink, grab, grab, oink, oink, oink, oink, oink, oink, oink, oink, oink, oink.

380
00:23:19,980 --> 00:23:20,980
Hey, now, it's okay.

381
00:23:20,980 --> 00:23:22,980
Just don't do it again.

382
00:23:22,980 --> 00:23:25,980
Oink, oink.

383
00:23:25,980 --> 00:23:28,980
Oink, oink, oink, oink.

384
00:23:28,980 --> 00:23:29,980
Oink, oink, oink, oink.

385
00:23:29,980 --> 00:23:31,980
Your pigs take care, okay?

386
00:23:31,980 --> 00:23:32,980
Oink.

387
00:23:32,980 --> 00:23:37,980
That was amazing, Noelle!

388
00:23:37,980 --> 00:23:39,980
Just don't give up and you'll be fine.

389
00:23:39,980 --> 00:23:41,980
We'll keep them all safe.

390
00:23:41,980 --> 00:23:42,980
Don't worry.

391
00:23:42,980 --> 00:23:44,980
Black Clover, page 10.

392
00:23:44,980 --> 00:23:45,980
Guardians.

393
00:23:45,980 --> 00:23:47,980
My magic is never giving up!

